  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--tight\" aria-labelledby=\"every-room\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split split--wide-text\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 id=\"every-room\">In every room</h2>\n            <p>Every room has an en-suite bathroom, a TV, and tea and coffee making facilities. WiFi is free throughout, and the whole hotel is non-smoking.</p>\n            <p class=\"muted\">Room layouts vary from one room to the next, as you&rsquo;d expect in a house built in 1874. If you need a particular bed set-up, mention it when you book or give us a call and we&rsquo;ll do our best to help.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>En-suite bathroom</li>\n              <li>Television</li>\n              <li>Tea and coffee making facilities</li>\n              <li>Free WiFi</li>\n              <li>Non-smoking rooms</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-label=\"Room types\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n\n        <article class=\"room\" id=\"single\" aria-labelledby=\"single-title\">\n          <div class=\"room__gallery room__gallery--two\">\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-single-1-lg.webp 1138w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-single-1-lg.jpg 1138w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" alt=\"Single room with a single bed, a white desk and grey chair, a bedside lamp and a window\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-single-2-lg.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-single-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-single-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-single-2-lg.jpg 960w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Single room with a chevron-patterned cushion, a desk with a TV and red artwork on the wall\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standard</p>\n            <h2 id=\"single-title\">Single Room</h2>\n            <p class=\"room__sleeps\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg>Sleeps 1 adult</p>\n            <p>A practical, comfortable room for one, with a single bed. It suits contractors, business travellers and anyone visiting family in Motherwell.</p>\n            <ul class=\"checklist checklist--2\">\n              <li>Single bed</li>\n              <li>En-suite bathroom</li>\n              <li>TV</li>\n              <li>Tea &amp; coffee</li>\n              <li>Free WiFi</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"book.html?rid=148837309972637\">Check availability<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Single Room</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"room\" id=\"twin\" aria-labelledby=\"twin-title\">\n          <div class=\"room__gallery room__gallery--two\">\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-twin-2-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Twin room with two single beds in teal throws, dark curtains and a canvas on the teal feature wall\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-twin-1-lg.webp 1258w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-twin-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-twin-1-lg.jpg 1258w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"636\" alt=\"Bedroom with two beds in grey throws against a teal wall, with two teal armchairs and a desk\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standard</p>\n            <h2 id=\"twin-title\">Twin Room</h2>\n            <p class=\"room__sleeps\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>Sleeps 2 adults</p>\n            <p>Two single beds. A good choice for friends, colleagues travelling together, or guests in town for a wedding or a match at Fir Park.</p>\n            <ul class=\"checklist checklist--2\">\n              <li>Two single beds</li>\n              <li>En-suite bathroom</li>\n              <li>TV</li>\n              <li>Tea &amp; coffee</li>\n              <li>Free WiFi</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"book.html?rid=148838930526405\">Check availability<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Twin Room</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"room\" id=\"double\" aria-labelledby=\"double-title\">\n          <div class=\"room__gallery\">\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-1-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"515\" alt=\"Double room with a large bay window, blue throw, armchair and the en-suite door open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-2-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-2-lg.webp 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-2-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-2-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-2-lg.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Double bed with a plum throw, a plum feature wall and wall lights\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-3-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-double-3-lg.webp 1343w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-double-3-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-double-3-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-double-3-lg.jpg 1343w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 25vw, 50vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"596\" alt=\"Double bed with a teal throw, tartan cushions and teal curtains\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standard</p>\n            <h2 id=\"double-title\">Double Room</h2>\n            <p class=\"room__sleeps\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>Sleeps 2 adults</p>\n            <p>A double bed for couples or anyone who likes a bit more room. Each one is decorated a little differently, and some have the bay windows that give the house its character.</p>\n            <ul class=\"checklist checklist--2\">\n              <li>Double bed</li>\n              <li>En-suite bathroom</li>\n              <li>TV</li>\n              <li>Tea &amp; coffee</li>\n              <li>Free WiFi</li>\n            </ul>\n            <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"book.html?rid=148839795253447\">Check availability<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Double Room</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"room\" id=\"family\" aria-labelledby=\"family-title\">\n          <div class=\"room__gallery room__gallery--single\">\n            <div class=\"media-frame\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.webp 800w, assets/img/room-family-1-lg.webp 1334w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"><img src=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/img/room-family-1-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/room-family-1-lg.jpg 1334w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Family room with a double bed and a single bed in white linen, beneath a colourful canvas\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Standard</p>\n            <h2 id=\"family-title\">Family Room</h2>\n            <p class=\"room__sleeps\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg>Sleeps up to 3 (one may be a child)</p>\n            <p>Space for the whole family, with a double bed and a single bed, so you can all stay together.</p>\n            <ul class=\"checklist checklist--2\">\n              <li>Double + single bed</li>\n              <li>En-suite bathroom</li>\n              <li>TV</li>\n              <li>Tea &amp; coffee</li>\n              <li>Free WiFi</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p class=\"small muted\">Travelling with a baby or need an extra bed? Please call us before booking so we can talk through what&rsquo;s available.</p>\n            <a class=\"btn btn--dark\" href=\"book.html?rid=158032272887993\">Check availability<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Family Room</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"compare\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Compare our rooms</p>\n          <h2 id=\"compare-title\">Which room is right for you?</h2>\n          <p>All four room types share the same essentials: an en-suite bathroom, a TV, tea and coffee making facilities and free WiFi. The difference is the beds, and how many people they sleep.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n          <table>\n            <caption class=\"visually-hidden\">Room types at Bentley Hotel compared by beds, how many guests they sleep and who they suit</caption>\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Room</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Beds</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Sleeps</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Good for</th>\n                <th scope=\"col\">Book</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"#single\">Single Room</a></th>\n                <td>One single bed</td>\n                <td>1 adult</td>\n                <td>Solo travellers, contractors and business trips, or a night near family in Motherwell</td>\n                <td><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"book.html?rid=148837309972637\">Check dates<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Single Room</span> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"#twin\">Twin Room</a></th>\n                <td>Two single beds</td>\n                <td>2 adults</td>\n                <td>Friends or colleagues sharing, wedding guests, or a match at Fir Park</td>\n                <td><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"book.html?rid=148838930526405\">Check dates<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Twin Room</span> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"#double\">Double Room</a></th>\n                <td>One double bed</td>\n                <td>2 adults</td>\n                <td>Couples, or anyone who&rsquo;d like a bit more space; some rooms have bay windows</td>\n                <td><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"book.html?rid=148839795253447\">Check dates<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Double Room</span> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <th scope=\"row\"><a href=\"#family\">Family Room</a></th>\n                <td>A double bed and a single bed</td>\n                <td>Up to 3 (one may be a child)</td>\n                <td>Parents with a child, or three people travelling together</td>\n                <td><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"book.html?rid=158032272887993\">Check dates<span class=\"visually-hidden\"> for the Family Room</span> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a></td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted mt-1\">Not sure which to choose, or booking for a group? Call us on <a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a> and we&rsquo;ll help you pick. If a particular bed set-up matters to you, tell us when you book.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--sand section--tight\" aria-labelledby=\"families-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split split--reverse\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Families</p>\n            <h2 id=\"families-title\">Staying with children</h2>\n            <p>Our family room has a double bed and a single bed and sleeps up to three guests, one of whom may be a child, so a couple with a child can share one room. Breakfast is cooked to order, and children are welcome in the restaurant.</p>\n            <p>If you&rsquo;re bringing a baby, or hoping for an extra bed, please speak to us before you book. No two rooms are quite the same shape, so we&rsquo;d rather talk it through with you first than have you arrive to a surprise.</p>\n            <p class=\"muted\">A bigger family? Book two rooms, mention it when you book, and we&rsquo;ll do our best to place them near each other.</p>\n            <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"location.html#nearby\">Things to do with children nearby <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <ul class=\"checklist\">\n              <li>Family room: a double and a single bed, sleeping up to 3</li>\n              <li>Cots and extra beds: please call us before booking</li>\n              <li>Children welcome in the restaurant, with breakfast cooked to order</li>\n              <li>Free on-site parking, so unloading the car is easy</li>\n              <li>Strathclyde Country Park about a mile away, M&amp;D&rsquo;s theme park about 2 miles</li>\n              <li>The North Lanarkshire Heritage Centre, free to visit, is next door</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--green\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Working in Motherwell?</p>\n          <h2 id=\"work-title\">A practical base for contractors and business travellers</h2>\n          <p class=\"lede\">Whether you&rsquo;re on site in Lanarkshire, in meetings in Glasgow or Edinburgh, or passing through on the M74, Bentley Hotel keeps a working stay simple.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3\">\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 17h6\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Free parking on site</h3>\n            <p>Park at the hotel for free for the length of your stay. There&rsquo;s nothing to pay and no permit to arrange.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 13a10 10 0 0 1 14 0\"/><path d=\"M8.5 16.5a5 5 0 0 1 7 0\"/><path d=\"M2 8.82a15 15 0 0 1 20 0\"/><path d=\"M12 20h.01\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Free WiFi</h3>\n            <p>Free WiFi throughout the hotel, for emails, calls home and the next day&rsquo;s paperwork.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M17 8h1a4 4 0 1 1 0 8h-1\"/><path d=\"M3 8h14v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 2v2\"/><path d=\"M10 2v2\"/><path d=\"M14 2v2\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>A cooked breakfast</h3>\n            <p>A full Scottish breakfast, cooked to order, before you head out.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M4 11h16\"/><path d=\"M12 3v8\"/><path d=\"m8 19-2 3\"/><path d=\"m18 22-2-3\"/><path d=\"M8 15h0\"/><path d=\"M16 15h0\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>5 minutes from the station</h3>\n            <p>Motherwell station is about 5 minutes&rsquo; walk. The fastest trains reach Glasgow Central in under 20 minutes, and there are services to Edinburgh too.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 22 8 2\"/><path d=\"m20 22-4-20\"/><path d=\"M12 6v2\"/><path d=\"M12 12v2\"/><path d=\"M12 18v2\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Close to the M74</h3>\n            <p>Junction 6 of the M74 (A723) is nearby, with the M8 a few miles north, so sites across Lanarkshire and the central belt are an easy drive.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 2v7c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2\"/><path d=\"M7 2v20\"/><path d=\"M21 15V2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v6c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h3Zm0 0v7\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Dinner without driving</h3>\n            <p>Our restaurant and bar are under the same roof. Opening times vary, so <a href=\"dining.html\">see the restaurant page</a> or call ahead.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"split split--wide-text mt-2\">\n          <div>\n            <h3>Weekly stays and team bookings</h3>\n            <p>Staying for a week or longer, or booking rooms for a team? Call us to arrange it. We&rsquo;ll talk through dates and room types with you, and single and twin rooms work well for colleagues on the same job.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"btn-row\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"tel:+441698265588\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.12 4.18 2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg>Call 01698 265588</a>\n            <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"contact.html?enquiry=Room+booking\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"m22 7-10 6L2 7\"/></svg>Send an enquiry</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section\" aria-labelledby=\"breakfast-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"split\">\n          <div>\n            <p class=\"eyebrow\">Breakfast</p>\n            <h2 id=\"breakfast-title\">Start the day with a full Scottish</h2>\n            <p>A full Scottish breakfast, cooked to order, is one of the things guests mention most. Your booking confirmation shows whether breakfast is included in your stay. If you&rsquo;re not sure, just give us a call.</p>\n            <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"dining.html\">Restaurant &amp; bar <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <dl class=\"info-list\">\n              <div><dt>What</dt><dd>A full Scottish breakfast, cooked when you order it</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>In the restaurant or the conservatory</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Dietary needs</dt><dd>Tell us when you book, or at breakfast, and we&rsquo;ll see what the kitchen can do</dd></div>\n              <div><dt>Early start?</dt><dd>Let us know the evening before</dd></div>\n            </dl>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"stay-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"section-intro\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Your stay</p>\n          <h2 id=\"stay-title\">The practical details</h2>\n          <p>A few things worth knowing before you arrive. If your question isn&rsquo;t answered here, call us on <a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a> and we&rsquo;ll sort it out.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid grid--3\">\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Arriving</h3>\n            <p>Check-in is from 2pm. Please let us know your arrival time in advance, especially if you&rsquo;ll be late in the evening, so someone is here to welcome you and hand over your key.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2 4v16\"/><path d=\"M2 8h18a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10\"/><path d=\"M2 17h20\"/><path d=\"M6 8v9\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>During your stay</h3>\n            <p>Tell us if you need anything during your stay, whether it&rsquo;s something for your room or a question about the area, and we&rsquo;ll do our best to help.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Luggage</h3>\n            <p>Arriving before 2pm, or leaving after 11am? Ask us about leaving your bags with us while you make the most of the day.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2 2l20 20\"/><path d=\"M12 12H2v4h14\"/><path d=\"M22 12v4\"/><path d=\"M18 12h-.5\"/><path d=\"M7 12v4\"/><path d=\"M18 8c0-2.5-2-2.5-2-5\"/><path d=\"M22 8c0-2.5-2-2.5-2-5\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Smoking</h3>\n            <p>Bentley Hotel is a non-smoking hotel throughout, in the bedrooms and in all public areas.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Pets and assistance animals</h3>\n            <p>Pets can&rsquo;t stay at the hotel, but assistance animals are welcome. Let us know when you book so we can be ready for you.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"feature reveal\">\n            <div class=\"feature__icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg></div>\n            <h3>Checking out</h3>\n            <p>Check-out is by 11am. If you&rsquo;d like a later check-out, ask and we&rsquo;ll help if we can. Payment and cancellation terms depend on the rate you book and are set out in your confirmation.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"section section--sand\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n      <div class=\"container container--narrow\">\n        <h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"center\">A few more questions</h2>\n        <div class=\"faq mt-2\">\n          <details>\n            <summary>Is breakfast included?</summary>\n            <div><p>It depends on the rate you book. Your booking confirmation shows whether breakfast is included in your stay. If you&rsquo;re not sure, call us on <a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a> before you travel and we&rsquo;ll check for you.</p></div>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Can I pay on arrival?</summary>\n            <div><p>Your booking confirmation explains the payment and cancellation terms for your rate, including when payment is taken. If anything in it is unclear, call us before your stay and we&rsquo;ll talk it through.</p></div>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Do the rooms have hairdryers and irons?</summary>\n            <div><p>Ask us when you book and we&rsquo;ll tell you what&rsquo;s in your room and what we can bring up for you. Every room has a TV and tea and coffee making facilities.</p></div>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Is there a lift, and is the hotel accessible?</summary>\n            <div><p>Bentley Hotel is a Victorian house, and many of our bedrooms are reached by stairs. If stairs are a concern, or anyone in your party has access needs, please call us on <a href=\"tel:+441698265588\">01698 265588</a> before booking. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly what we can offer for your dates, including any ground-floor options, and help you find the most suitable room. There&rsquo;s more on our <a href=\"accessibility.html\">accessibility page</a>.</p></div>\n          </details>\n          <details>\n            <summary>Why book direct?</summary>\n            <div><p>Booking with us directly means you&rsquo;re dealing with the hotel itself, so you can ask us anything about your stay before you arrive. Use our <a href=\"book.html\">online booking</a> or call 01698 265588.</p></div>\n          </details>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"center small muted mt-2\">More questions answered on our <a href=\"faq.html\">questions and answers page</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  },
  {
   "type": "html",
   "html": "<section class=\"cta-band\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 id=\"cta-title\">Ready to stay?</h2>\n          <p>See live availability and book in a couple of minutes.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"btn-row\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"book.html\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><path d=\"M3 10h18\"/></svg>Book now</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"tel:+441698265588\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.12 4.18 2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"/></svg>01698 265588</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
  }
